{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":28,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["对北国的警告"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"祸哉！以法莲的酒徒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"住在肥美谷的山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们心里高傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以所夸的为冠冕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹如将残之花。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，主有一大能大力者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像一阵冰雹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像毁灭的暴风，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像涨溢的大水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必用手将冠冕摔落于地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲高傲的酒徒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的冠冕必被踏在脚下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那荣美将残之花，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是在肥美谷山上的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必像夏令以前初熟的无花果；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看见这果的就注意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一到手中就吞吃了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"到那日，万军之耶和华","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必作他余剩之民的荣冠华冕，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也作了在位上行审判者公平之灵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并城门口打退仇敌者的力量。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以赛亚和犹大酒醉的先知"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"就是这地的人也因酒摇摇晃晃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因浓酒东倒西歪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司和先知因浓酒摇摇晃晃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被酒所困，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因浓酒东倒西歪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们错解默示，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谬行审判。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为各席上满了呕吐的污秽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无一处干净。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"讥诮先知的说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要将知识指教谁呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使谁明白传言呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是那刚断奶离怀的吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他竟命上加命，令上加令，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"律上加律，例上加例，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这里一点，那里一点。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"先知说：不然，主要借异邦人的嘴唇","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和外邦人的舌头对这百姓说话。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他曾对他们说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要使疲乏人得安息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样才得安息，才得舒畅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们却不肯听。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，耶和华向他们说的话是","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"命上加命，令上加令，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"律上加律，例上加例，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这里一点，那里一点，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致他们前行仰面跌倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而且跌碎，并陷入网罗被缠住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["锡安的房角石"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"所以，你们这些亵慢的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是辖管住在耶路撒冷这百姓的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要听耶和华的话。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们曾说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们与死亡立约，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与阴间结盟；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敌军","poem":1},{"noteId":25},{"text":"如水涨漫经过的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必不临到我们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我们以谎言为避所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在虚假以下藏身。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，主耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，我在锡安放一块石头作为根基，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是试验过的石头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是稳固根基，宝贵的房角石；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"信靠的人必不着急。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必以公平为准绳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以公义为线铊。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"冰雹必冲去谎言的避所；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大水必漫过藏身之处。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们与死亡所立的约必然废掉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与阴间所结的盟必立不住。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敌军","poem":1},{"noteId":26},{"text":"如水涨漫经过的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必被他践踏；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每逢经过必将你们掳去。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为每早晨他必经过，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"白昼黑夜都必如此。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明白传言的必受惊恐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"原来，床榻短，使人不能舒身；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被窝窄，使人不能遮体。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华必兴起，像在毗拉心山；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必发怒，像在基遍谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好做成他的工，就是非常的工；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成就他的事，就是奇异的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在你们不可亵慢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恐怕捆你们的绑索更结实了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我从主—万军之耶和华那里听见，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"已经决定在全地上施行灭绝的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["神的智慧"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"你们当侧耳听我的声音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"留心听我的言语。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那耕地为要撒种的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂是常常耕地呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂是常常开垦耙地呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他拉平了地面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂不就撒种小茴香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"播种大茴香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"按行列种小麦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在定处种大麦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在田边种粗麦呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他的 神教导他务农相宜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并且指教他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"原来打小茴香，不用尖利的器具，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"轧大茴香，也不用碌碡","poem":1},{"noteId":27},{"text":"；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但用杖打小茴香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用棍打大茴香。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做饼的粮食是用磨磨碎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因它不必常打；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽用碌碡和马打散，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却不磨它。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这也是出于万军之耶和华—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的谋略奇妙；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的智慧广大。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":25,"caller":"-","text":"原文是鞭子","reference":{"chapter":28,"verse":15}},{"noteId":26,"caller":"-","text":"原文是鞭子","reference":{"chapter":28,"verse":18}},{"noteId":27,"caller":"-","text":"原文是车轮；下同","reference":{"chapter":28,"verse":27}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/28.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/29.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/27.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":29}